ine Chefin fragt, wen du für das Projekt vorschlägst.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":5,"text":"Der Verlag, dessen Autoren bekannt sind, zahlt besser. — Aber der andere, dessen Lektoren gut sind, arbeitet genauer.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-37-relativsaetze-genitiv","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-37-relativsaetze-genitiv","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":5,"text":"Rollenspiel: Ihr stellt zwei Verlage vor.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false}],"controls":{"story-play-line":5,"story-play-all":1,"vword-voice-F":50,"vword-voice-M":50,"vword-listen":50,"listen-to-passage":1,"audio-play-btn":1,"hear-model":5},"surfaces":[{"n":1,"w":"Bedeutungsnuancen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":7,"w":"die","from":"vocab-article","type":"Article"},{"n":1,"w":"Bedeutungsverluste","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":5,"w":"der","from":"vocab-article","type":"Article"},{"n":1,"w":"Einflüsse","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Listen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Textzusammenhänge","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Anlagen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"— (Sg.)","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Besprechungen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Buchbesprechungen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Empfindungen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Charaktere","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Flügel","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Konzepte","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":2,"w":"das","from":"vocab-article","type":"Article"},{"n":2,"w":"Der","from":"reading","type":"Article","role":"plain"},{"n":1,"w":"neue","from":"reading","typ